<description>&lt;p&gt;Ansar al-Sunna militants continue targeting civilians in Cabo Delgado, hindering humanitarian access as barriers in Macomia persist. The Mozambican government is moving forward with a large LNG megaproject concept, with a final investment decision approaching, and DP World is expanding its port investment in the country. Youth protests and broader political discontent are rising, reflecting growing frustration with the security situation and governance. 151 battle-related deaths occurred in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Times of India&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiigFBVV95cUxPZkZrNEZiUDVxZmVhdkVUYUVNRVc4SU5kUFcyenNoRVdhRkpfVDRXb0ZOQVJ1dFJUY2lzUEFKRG5rN1NjZ0c4QnVRcHJHX2NXbFJuTjRDbm1hLWhZcGViSGhTVVQxUWNNUXFLcWtOZ0NOQWhYOGpEeldZdjA0ZUlkMTctVFRtaUNfR1E?oc=5&quot;&gt;Yeni Safak English&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMimgFBVV95cUxOYzZLWVVaYnoyLW9zbS00X2VSNFFYdXJVVEc3TDBUVXpfS0UwR2YyLVlMcnFtd0FkME53dURtTlFLakVJWVJ6ajBOaHdrUGNuT2dFWENsLVRWUXdyRVZlV3NGOEt0MUxGQjVuUXhfYjc5a2d0ZnMzbllNZVFmY0NwX1E3RE54M1RFUWNKN3hPMUk1QVIyMUxEekdR?oc=5&quot;&gt;Yeni Safak English&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMimAFBVV95cUxQckZNbS1pZzY5dG5oU1hQOXNiV08yUW44UE9YN1pzWjNPaDlYRTVuaElyUmY0VVRsSnN1dXFTVGJ1LVotS3RfVmFDOXJOWUZ5SjVWZUs5bF9YNVJ4VHFhM0llWHpDQ3FRalBwMXhBR0FtNDdDMGdfNThBbmliRzlvemZFTmJsTHBrR1ExWllYb1BXbEZ5OUJDUw?oc=5&quot;&gt;AfricaSoccer.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMipwFBVV95cUxOa2FDRUItUF9WcllBWUhRbks4R1FuLS02TWE5OWgzYms3XzR4WkdiQU11MXA3ajRvRU0zSEJGU0hVbjFaemJPREFvT3c1UGJYVU5aRm1UUktHVkhpbzN3UUJWMEdqc09LUEgyNGd4Q1Nld05OVVlhMzlZZERMZFhsc09oQ3Ftc25iT3JQaVBRVWpGMlRWRDFuXzJhZGd1VExRTTVGbXF3bw?oc=5&quot;&gt;Arab News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a 